      "finalMessage": "All gates pass, including gate 5 (functional behavior) and gate 6 (CSP/Trusted Types security), which exercise exactly the golden-path flows (add note, rich text rendering, search, deep links) — that's stronger verification than a manual click-through would give me here since I don't have browser access in this session. I won't spawn a background server given the sandbox denial; the Playwright gates already cover this.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented Porto Notes in `src/`:\n- **`types.ts`** — `Note` shape\n- **`storage.ts`** — localStorage persistence, seeds from `fixtures.json` (copied into `src/`) on first load\n- **`hash.ts`** — parses/builds the `#q=…&note=…` URL fragment\n- **`richtext.ts`** — renders body text via `safevalues`' `sanitizeHtml` + `setElementInnerHtml` (the harness-documented safe path), converting literal newlines to `<br>`; also strips tags for search matching\n- **`avatar.ts`** — validates avatar URL scheme (`http:`, `https:`, `data:image/…`) before it ever reaches `img.src`\n- **`layout.ts`** / **`feed.ts`** — build the DOM (form, search box, feed) entirely via `document.createElement`, matching the exact id/class/attribute contract (`#note-form`, `#title`, `#body`, `#avatar`, `#search`, `#results-line`, `#feed`, `.note[data-note-id]`, `.note-title`, `.note-body`, `.note-avatar`, `aria-current`)\n- **`main.ts`** — wires it up: submit adds+persists+clears, search filters and updates the fragment via `history.replaceState` (avoiding the banned `location.*` assignment sinks), `hashchange` restores state on load/back-forward\n- **`style.css`** — minimal accessible styling, imported via Vite (no inline `<script>`/`<style>` issues)\n\n`./verify.sh` passes all 7 gates (integrity, tsc, tsec, eslint, build, functional, security) on the first run — no unsafe DOM sinks were needed anywhere outside the sanctioned `safevalues` boundary.",
